a bakhna rakhna~
A small, white, goblin-like creature skulks around here.
~
He looks like a goblin, except he is pale white in color, and his ratty hair
is a light shade of yellow. He has a flat face and sloping forehead, with a
broad nose, and pointed ears. His wide mouth is filled with sharp fangs. He
is short, but lanky, and his long arms hang to his knees.
~
