#20303
mist giant creature~
the Mist Giant~
A giant mist creature is here, waiting for its next victim.
~
It's white, like mist, yet somehow darker. Stretching high above your head, it
is nearly eight feet tall, and almost as broad. Two eyes, the color of thin,
yellow wine, are set high in the creature's body, though it has no distinct
head. A mouthish slit filled with fangs lies just beneath the eyes. It has no
nose or ears that you can see. Four appendages spring from its upper parts,
and its lower body slithers along the ground, unsupported by any limbs.
~
